{"title": "Mandor", "pageid": 2121, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><b>Mandor</b></i> is step brother to<i> <a href=\"/wiki/Merlin\" title=\"Merlin\">Merlin&#160;</a></i> and next in line of succession to become King of Chaos. Mandor had long white hair and is proficient in magic of the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Logrus\" title=\"The Logrus\">Logrus</a>. Merlin often turns to Mandor for advise and has always been in good relations with him.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Mandor?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260429124221\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 321/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.610      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    1.610      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2121-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260429124221 and revision id 4444. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Merlin", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Logrus", "exists": true}], "url": "https://amber.fandom.com/ru/wiki/Mandor"}